ion-Energy & Innovation Full-Time Education Program Manager I- Division of Energy & Innovation (On-Site) Associate General Counsel 496673 Chancellor/President-Chancellor/President Full-Time Renders legal advice, services, and representation to the University of Houston System and its component institutions. Serves as a higher education legal generalist for the University of Houston System and its component institutions. Enterprise IT Security Analyst (Broadband) 497177 VC/VP, Admin & Finance-Information Technology Full-Time The Analyst I Enterprise IT Security role is an entry-level cybersecurity position responsible for providing front-line operational support to the UH System Security Operations Center and Investigation Team. The position supports intake, triage, documentation, customer communication, metrics, reporting, and investigation-related activities for information security events across the UH System, while also participating in an on-call rotation. It requires foundational knowledge of IT or cybersecurity concepts, at least six months of related technical or analytical experience, the ability to obtain an approved entry-level cybersecurity certification within one year, and a commitment to ongoing learning as security tools, practices, and technologies evolve. Web Developer II 497110 Univ Marketing & Comm Division-Univ Marketing & Comm Division Full-Time Supports a college or department website, including writing HTML documents, creating graphics, digitizing pictures, and inserting audio and video to enhance the look and feel of the website. Apply now First Name (required) a7d06d05 Last Name (required) 6eaee6f3 Email (required) 1670ee1a Cell number e0dadf7a 244 results found No results found Afghanistan (+93) Åland Islands (+358) Albania (+355) Algeria (+213) American Samoa (+1) Andorra (+376) Angola (+244) Anguilla (+1) Antigua & Barbuda (+1) Argentina (+54) Armenia (+374) Aruba (+297) Ascension Island (+247) Australia (+61) Austria (+43) Azerbaijan (+9